{"path":"thread/packaged_task/reset","title":"std::packaged_task<R(Args...)>::reset","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::packaged_task&lt;R(Args...)&gt;::</span>reset","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task/reset","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Resets the state abandoning the results of previous executions. New shared state is constructed.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> reset<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Resets the state abandoning the results of previous executions. New shared state is constructed.\n</p><p>Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> packaged_task<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, where <code>f</code> is the stored task.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<ul><li> <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future_error\">std::future_error</a></span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> has no shared state. The error condition is set to <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future_errc\"><code>no_state</code></a>.\n</li><li> <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/new/bad_alloc\">std::bad_alloc</a></span> if there was not enough memory for a new shared state.\n</li><li> Any exception thrown by the <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task/packaged_task\">move constructor</a> of the new <code>packaged_task</code>.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cmath&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;future&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;thread&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/packaged_task\"><span class=\"kw2203\">std::<span class=\"me2\">packaged_task</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>,<span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> task<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> a, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> b<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/pow\"><span class=\"kw1340\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pow</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a, b<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future\"><span class=\"kw2201\">std::<span class=\"me2\">future</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> result <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> task.<span class=\"me1\">get_future</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    task<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">9</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"2^9 = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> result.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    task.<span class=\"me1\">reset</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    result <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> task.<span class=\"me1\">get_future</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/thread\"><span class=\"kw2167\">std::<span class=\"me2\">thread</span></span></a> task_td<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>task<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    task_td.<span class=\"me1\">join</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"2^10 = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> result.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>2^9 = 512\n2^10 = 1024</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/packaged_task","title":"std::packaged_task"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::packaged_task<R(Args...)>::reset","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Resets the state abandoning the results of previous executions."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions"},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":135,"codeBlockCount":2}
